step Mulgris Deepriver
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears.
  accept 4984                         -- Inside

step Tirion Fordring
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride north along the eastern hills; Tirion lives in a small house by the Thondroril River, at the border with the Eastern Plaguelands.
  accept 5542
  accept 5543
  accept 5544
  note Tirion's hunts are in the Eastern Plaguelands: keep them for later.

step Augustus the Touched
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Cross the river east into Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge.
  accept 6164                         -- Inside

step Terrordale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale; the undead in the town are 54-56, so pull them one at a time.
  tip The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass.
  collect 15884 quest 6164 @17.4,31.1 -- Upstairs
  collect 15043 quest 5901
  collect 12840 x20 optional -- Minion's Scourgestones: the Terrordale undead drop them while you wear the Argent Dawn Commission
  note Keep Augustus' Receipt Book: Augustus takes it back on the Eastern Plaguelands guide's Terrordale stop.

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ride back west over the river and on to the Northridge Lumber Camp; Kirsta hides on the hill north-east of it.
  accept 6004

step Level 52.63
