  level 54.3 grind 7101               -- grind on Warpwood Shredder

step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. Chieftain Bloodmaw (56) stands among them. Meilosh, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village.
  accept 6031 optional                -- Meilosh: keep 30 Runecloth for him; he trades only at Neutral with the Timbermaw; below ground

step Nafien
  tip The road ends at Nafien, outside the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in the far north-east.
  turnin 8462
  accept 8461

step Felpaw Village
  tip Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.
  tip Below level 54.54, keep fighting the Deadwood here after Nafien's count: the hand-ins at Timbermaw Hold and the Emerald Sanctuary take you to level 55. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Depths dungeon or the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.
  tip Keep killing them until one drops a Deadwood Ritual Totem, about one kill in thirty, then right-click it: Kernda in Timbermaw Hold takes it once the Timbermaw are Neutral to you, now if they already are, or when the last guide passes the cave again at 59.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3
  collect 20741                       -- Deadwood Ritual Totem
  accept 8470
  level 54.54 grind 7156               -- grind on Deadwood Den Watcher

